{"totalItems":12,"success":true,"errors":[],"results":[{"productId":18746,"name":"Prismatic Omen","cleanName":"Prismatic Omen","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/18746_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":102,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/18746/magic-shadowmoor-prismatic-omen","modifiedOn":"2022-04-06T14:37:41.51","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"R"},{"name":"SubType","displayName":"Creature Type or Sub Type","value":"Enchantment"},{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Lands you control are every basic land type in addition to their other types."}]},{"productId":27306,"name":"Shadowmoor - Booster Box","cleanName":"Shadowmoor Booster Box","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/27306_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":102,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/27306/magic-shadowmoor-shadowmoor-booster-box","modifiedOn":"2013-05-09T12:13:41.653","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[]},{"productId":27368,"name":"Shadowmoor - Booster Pack","cleanName":"Shadowmoor Booster Pack","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/27368_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":102,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/27368/magic-shadowmoor-shadowmoor-booster-pack","modifiedOn":"2013-05-09T12:13:41.653","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[]},{"productId":78330,"name":"Shadowmoor - Fat Pack","cleanName":"Shadowmoor Fat Pack","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/78330_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":102,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/78330/magic-shadowmoor-shadowmoor-fat-pack","modifiedOn":"2019-10-11T12:13:22.017","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[]},{"productId":185142,"name":"Shadowmoor Theme Deck - Aura Mastery","cleanName":"Shadowmoor Theme Deck Aura Mastery","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/185142_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":102,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/185142/magic-shadowmoor-shadowmoor-theme-deck-aura-mastery","modifiedOn":"2019-02-16T17:47:18.19","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"When playing the \"Aura Mastery\" deck, you control the Auras, so you'll control the game! Prison Term and Curse of Chains are Auras that lock down your opponent's creatures. Armored Ascension and Steel of the Godhead are Auras that enhance your own creatures, supercharging them into mighty combatants. Mine Excavation can return an expended Aura from your graveyard to your hand. And Glamer Spinners, which can be played at any time, moves Auras from one permanent to another—including itself—when it comes into play!\r\n<br><br>\r\nBut the fun doesn't end there! When you consider the cards that create surprise blockers and the cards that let you tap your opponent's creatures at will, it will be clear that Auras aren't the only things you've mastered."}]},{"productId":185143,"name":"Shadowmoor Theme Deck - Overkill","cleanName":"Shadowmoor Theme Deck Overkill","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/185143_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":102,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/185143/magic-shadowmoor-shadowmoor-theme-deck-overkill","modifiedOn":"2019-02-16T17:48:02.36","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"If you believe that anything worth doing is worth overdoing, then the \"Overkill\" deck is right up your alley. It's filled with brutal creatures like Boggart Ram-Gang and spells like Flame Javelin that'll burn your opponent's creatures to a crisp. But when you're tired of fighting fair, the deck pulls out its secret weapons!\r\n<br><br>\r\nJaws of Stone deals damage equal to the number of Mountains you control. Howl of the Night Pack gives you a 2/2 Wolf for each Forest you control. Both are good in their own right. However, thanks to Elsewhere Flask and Prismatic Omen—which turn all your lands into Mountains or Forests—these mighty spells can be mind-bogglingly, jaw-droppingly explosive.\r\n<br><br>But the fun doesn't end there! When you consider the cards that create surprise blockers and the cards that let you tap your opponent's creatures at will, it will be clear that Auras aren't the only things you've mastered."}]},{"productId":185144,"name":"Shadowmoor Theme Deck - Mortal Coil","cleanName":"Shadowmoor Theme Deck Mortal Coil","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/185144_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":102,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/185144/magic-shadowmoor-shadowmoor-theme-deck-mortal-coil","modifiedOn":"2019-02-16T17:48:40.267","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Like to exploit weakness? Then grab the \"Mortal Coil\" deck! This deck focuses on tricks you can pull with -1/-1 counters. Of course, the most basic \"trick\" is simply to put them on your opponent's creatures, which Grim Poppet, Torture, and Incremental Blight do with ease. But you're cleverer than that!\r\n<br><br>\r\nThe deck has lots of creatures with persist, like Gravelgill Axeshark. When one dies, if it didn't have a -1/-1 counter on it, it'll return to play with a -1/-1 counter. Then use Leech Bonder or Fate Transfer to move that -1/-1 counter to one of your opponent's creatures! Your opponent gets weaker, you get stronger, and persist is set to go again. Winning the game has never been so hilariously cruel."}]},{"productId":185145,"name":"Shadowmoor Theme Deck - Army of Entropy","cleanName":"Shadowmoor Theme Deck Army of Entropy","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/185145_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":102,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/185145/magic-shadowmoor-shadowmoor-theme-deck-army-of-entropy","modifiedOn":"2019-02-16T17:49:35.84","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"If you're ready to win without mercy, then the \"Army of Entropy\" deck is for you. This horde of marauding creatures is supplemented by spells and abilities that load up your opponent's creatures with -1/-1 counters. If Scar, Puncture Bolt, or a creature with wither kills an enemy creature, you're rewarded with another -1/-1 counter for a different creature, courtesy of Blowfly Infestation!\r\n<br><br>\r\nWhat happens if the -1/-1 counters don't inflict death on their recipients? No problem—Kulrath Knight will neutralize those creatures anyway. Barring that, your ravenous forces can just run over the depleted defenders. By the time you play Din of the Fireherd to both add to your army and demolish your opponent's board position, the game is all but over."}]},{"productId":185146,"name":"Shadowmoor Theme Deck - Turnabout","cleanName":"Shadowmoor Theme Deck Turnabout","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/185146_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":102,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/185146/magic-shadowmoor-shadowmoor-theme-deck-turnabout","modifiedOn":"2019-02-16T17:50:04.027","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Normally, tapping your creatures leaves you defenseless. With the \"Turnabout\" deck, having a bunch of tapped creatures leaves you primed to strike! Safehold Sentry, Pale Wayfarer, and any creature equipped by Umbral Mantle have  abilities that let them untap to provide an awesome bonus! Devoted Druid and Barrenton Medic can also untap at a moment's notice.\r\n<br><br>\r\nTake advantage of all your extra untaps not just by being ready to block, but also by playing spells with conspire, by using Revelsong Horn to pump up a creature, and by enchanting a creature with Presence of Gond to quickly create an army of Elves. Use your tapping and untapping tricks to support a swarming, opportunistic fighting force, and you'll run circles around your opponent!"}]},{"productId":185147,"name":"Shadowmoor Tournament Pack","cleanName":"Shadowmoor Tournament Pack","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/185147_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":102,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/185147/magic-shadowmoor-shadowmoor-tournament-pack","modifiedOn":"2019-02-16T17:53:55.323","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Each Shadowmoor tounrnament pack contains 75 cards including 3 rare, 10 uncommon, 33 common and 29 basic land.<em>(Foils are randomly inserted)</em>"}]},{"productId":644349,"name":"Shadowmoor Theme Deck Display","cleanName":"Shadowmoor Theme Deck Display","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/644349_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":102,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/644349/magic-shadowmoor-shadowmoor-theme-deck-display","modifiedOn":"2025-08-01T16:08:49.137","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Each Shadowmoor Theme Deck Display contains 12 decks."}]},{"productId":693106,"name":"Shadowmoor - Tournament Pack Display","cleanName":"Shadowmoor Tournament Pack Display","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/693106_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":102,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/693106/magic-shadowmoor-shadowmoor-tournament-pack-display","modifiedOn":"2026-05-04T17:37:02.543","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<br>Contains 12 Tournament Packs\r\n<br>Each tournament pack contains 75 cards."}]}]}